name: Judgement — joker spawn
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: Judgement Tarot creates a Joker. Tight Ante 1 event: the tarot spawns a useful
  joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - judgement: [1]
should:
  - tarotCard: Judgement
    score: 45
  - joker: Showman
    score: 35
  - joker: FortuneTeller
    score: 25
